   7: def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:
   8:     """Paint every background cell on the same row/column parity lattice as the single colored marker.
   9: 
  10:     Input structure
  11:     - A 2D grid containing black background pixels, grey fixed pixels, and exactly one non-grey/non-black colored marker pixel.
  12: 
  13:     Rule
  14:     - The marker's row parity and column parity define the selected lattice.
  15:     - Recolor each black background pixel with the marker color iff both its row parity and column parity match the marker.
  16:     - Leave grey pixels and all background pixels on the other three parity lattices unchanged.
